# Expected changes of the W6 frontend release (frontend#2, 2026-10-06): frontend only.
# Buying power is marked to live quotes and moves between the before and after
# snapshots on its own; nothing in this release touches account data.
model.*.account_summary.buying_power
# The same live marks move current equity, so every return built on it shifts in the
# fourth decimal (PROD after-check 2026-10-06: equity +8.62, net liquidation +2.86 / +5.76).
model.*.account_summary.net_liquidation
perf.unrealized.current_equity
perf.unrealized.return_pct
perf.transaction.capital_base
perf.transaction.start_equity
perf.summary.return_pct
perf.calendar[*].return_pct
perf.calendar_by_sec_type[*].return_pct
perf.realized_by_sec_type[*].return_pct
perf.realized_by_strategy_opportunity[*].return_pct
perf.realized_by_trade[*].return_pct
